summary:
On the eve of the AI Action Summit in Paris, we proudly announce our AI Safety Debate with Prof. Yoshua Bengio!📢
Next to @Yoshua_Bengio, we have in the panel:
@billyperrigo from @TIME
@kncukier from @TheEconomist
Jaan Tallinn from @FLI_org & @CSERCambridge
@ECVerhoeff from @MinBZ
@dw2 will be our moderator.
Our debate will take place 9 February 20:00 at @LeCnam and is publicly accessible, because we think that 1) AI existential risks need to be discussed, and 2) this discussion needs to be public.
Join here!

